---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About | Your Name" description="Background, skills and approach to quality.">
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold">About</h1>
  <p class="mt-4">
    Replace this with your story: how you got into QA, what you care about, and how you think about
    quality.
  </p>
  <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-semibold">Skills</h2>
  <ul class="mt-2 list-disc pl-6">
    <li>Test design and risk-based testing</li>
    <li>Test automation with Playwright and TypeScript</li>
    <li>API testing</li>
    <li>Accessibility (WCAG 2.2)</li>
  </ul>
</Layout>
